      "writtenOn": "2026-07-15T05:54:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This change scopes to %L, %I, %T, %C, %S. The remaining markers currently pass\n  through unchanged per DSP0218 Table 42 (an unrecognized %-marker is left as-is).\n\n  I don\u0027t have a concrete plan to add %PD/%PF/%PI right now: I haven\u0027t seen a\n  device that emits them, and I don\u0027t have one on hand to validate against. If that\n  changes, the marker table (string_view marker plus an arity) keeps each addition\n  localized to a new row.",
